From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 21:34:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Expand horizontal tabs to CSS tab-size stops

HarfRust shapes a tab as an ordinary glyph (usually the font's missing
glyph, painted as a box) with a ~1-space advance. Chrome treats a tab
as invisible whitespace that advances the pen to the next multiple of
tab-size x space-advance from the line start.

Expand tabs at line-commit time, when the pen position within the line
is known: rewrite the tab cluster's advance (and its glyph) to the
tab stop, swapping the glyph for the font's space glyph (no outlines)
when the font has one, so paint draws nothing. Rewriting the
cluster/glyph advances keeps run offsets, line metrics, hit-testing
and selection consistent.

Thread the CSS tab-size value through TextStyle, ResolvedStyle and the
layout Style so explicit tab-size values are honored (default 8).

parley_engine owns the shaped clusters and glyphs, so this half only
adds the (doc-hidden) mutable accessors the line-commit rewrite needs;
the expansion itself lives in the parley series.
---
 parley_engine/src/shape/shaped_text.rs | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/parley_engine/src/shape/shaped_text.rs b/parley_engine/src/shape/shaped_text.rs
index 63afadd..b42070c 100644
--- a/parley_engine/src/shape/shaped_text.rs
+++ b/parley_engine/src/shape/shaped_text.rs
@@ -245,6 +245,21 @@ impl ShapedText {
         &self.glyphs
     }
 
+    /// Mutable access to the shaped clusters, for `parley`'s line-commit rewrites (tab
+    /// stops, whose advance depends on the pen position within the line). Not public API.
+    #[doc(hidden)]
+    #[inline(always)]
+    pub fn shaped_clusters_mut(&mut self) -> &mut [ShapedCluster] {
+        &mut self.shaped_clusters
+    }
+
+    /// Mutable access to the shaped glyphs; see [`Self::shaped_clusters_mut`].
+    #[doc(hidden)]
+    #[inline(always)]
+    pub fn glyphs_mut(&mut self) -> &mut [Glyph] {
+        &mut self.glyphs
+    }
+
     /// The fonts.
     ///
     /// [`ShapedRun::font_index`] indexes into this.
